The MCP registry: `MCPServer` and `MCPTool` records, a discovery pass that reconciles a server's advertised tools with the registry, and the `services/mcp.py` client that speaks streamable HTTP and nothing else. Every tool arrives disabled and marked mutating whatever the server claims about it, and stays that way until an operator says otherwise (ADR 0007, Phase 4B rules M1-M5, M8). A `discovermcptools` management command runs the same pass from a shell. Nothing calls a tool yet; the agent that will arrives in the next release.
